Ok, working one of the most promising Wizards I've rolled up in a long 
time.  Generated on an Altar, converted it in one try, had ID and MM 
already, found a scroll shop early, found amulet of life saving!

Then some pesky nymph wench came by and helped herself to my amulet!  I 
tracked her down, and hit her with a sleep spell, but couldn't figure 
out a way to get my amulet from her with her still alive, she started to 
fight again, so I killed her, sure enough, she was wearing MY AMULET!

What could I have done to get it back without killing her and using it 
up?  Is there some little known pickpocket command to strip sleeping 
monsters of their goodies?

